          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū SEEBA alī na ng'hūmbū",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee bing'we banhū ba Sayūni, abo mulī bazengi ba mu Yelusalemu, mutikala mukūlīlaga ng'hūngū. Ūlū ng'ūlīla mulīkooba kūgunanhwa akūmuchīla shigongo! Ūlū wigwa ī ng'hūngū ying'we akūng'winha ishosho haho na haho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū SEEBA nūūlū akamulisha ngatī gwa makoye, na a minzī ūng'winha ga būluhi, nahene a balangi bing'we batalibisa hangī na hado. Mukūbabona na miso ging'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū mukatala ū mu nzīla ng'ūlola kū būlyo nūūlū kū lūmoso, nahene a matū ging'we gakwigwa ilaka ū kū numa līkūhayaga, “Ī nzīla yīyī, shimīzīlagi mo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī shiikolile shing'we ī sha kūlamiwa īsho shinaagīlilwe feza, nī shisho shikundīkījiwe zahabu ya kwaabiwa, mukūshisola mushisosohaje, hama mushiponye kūle gītī shikolo sha malofu. Mukūshiwīla, “Īngagi a henaha!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī mbulà akūng'wenhela kūlwa kūshizwisha īsho mukūhambaga hasī, nī shilīwa īsho shikūzwaga ū mu malaale ging'we shikūbiza na nguzu, hangī shingī. Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo ī mitugo jing'we jikūdīīmīla mu matogolo magalī ga maswa mingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nzīkū nī nzobe jing'we ī ja kūlīma, jikūyūdīīma maswa masoga gagaliililwe chiza gūsanja sanjiwa gūsandūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū lwenūlo lūkūbiza lūshikū lwa kūyagaala kūtaale, ng'hambī ja kūpīlīla jikūholomolwa, na minzī gakūyūtoloma kūfuma hose hose ū mu ngūlū ī ndīhu nī ndo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būpe bo ng'weji būkūbiza gītī būng'weku bo līīmi, ū būng'weku bo līīmi ū wene būkwiyongeja ng'hangala mpungatī, būbiza gītī būng'weku bo malīīmi ga shikū mpungatī ūlū gūsangījiwa hamò; ū lwenūlo lūkūbiza lūshikū lwa ng'wa SEEBA kūgatunga a magulaagīje ga banhū bakwe, na kūbapīja ū mu būminyiwa ūbo akabaminya ng'wikanza īlo wabatūlaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
